"version": 1,
"versionNonce": 693022458,
"isDeleted": false,
"boundElements": null,
"updated": 1,
"link": null,
"locked": false,
"text": "Qué tenemos / qué pide:",
"fontSize": 14,
"fontFamily": 2,
"textAlign": "left",
"verticalAlign": "top",
"baseline": 11,
"containerId": null,
"originalText": "Qué tenemos / qué pide:",
"lineHeight": 1.25
},
{
"id": "tex_a9bdfcdfa7f4",
"type": "text",
"x": 1174,
"y": 698.0,
"width": 808,
"height": 37.5,
"angle": 0,
"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
"backgroundColor": "transparent",
"fillStyle": "solid",
"strokeWidth": 1,
"strokeStyle": "solid",
"roughness": 0,
"opacity": 100,
"groupIds": [],
"frameId": null,
"roundness": null,
"seed": 12911564,
"version": 1,
"versionNonce": 1215319407,
"isDeleted": false,
"boundElements": null,
"updated": 1,
"link": null,
"locked": false,
"text": "→ Entradas: ninguna leída en tiempo de ejecución; el estado de flores/papeles de la\nciudad se configura antes de correr.",
"fontSize": 15,
"fontFamily": 2,
"textAlign": "left",
"verticalAlign": "top",
"baseline": 12,
"containerId": null,
"originalText": "→ Entradas: ninguna leída en tiempo de ejecución; el estado de flores/papeles de la\nciudad se configura antes de correr.",
"lineHeight": 1.25
},
{
"id": "tex_27f68962cfd5",
"type": "text",
"x": 1174,
"y": 739.5,
"width": 808,
"height": 37.5,
"angle": 0,
"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
"backgroundColor": "transparent",
"fillStyle": "solid",
"strokeWidth": 1,
"strokeStyle": "solid",
"roughness": 0,
"opacity": 100,
"groupIds": [],
"frameId": null,
"roundness": null,
"seed": 890211778,
"version": 1,
"versionNonce": 1772804974,
"isDeleted": false,
"boundElements": null,
"updated": 1,
"link": null,
"locked": false,
"text": "→ Salidas: un `Informar(1)` o `Informar(0)` por cada una de las 100 avenidas, según\nhaya tenido a lo sumo 45 flores hasta la esquina vacía.",
"fontSize": 15,
"fontFamily": 2,
"textAlign": "left",
"verticalAlign": "top",
"baseline": 12,
"containerId": null,
"originalText": "→ Salidas: un `Informar(1)` o `Informar(0)` por cada una de las 100 avenidas, según\nhaya tenido a lo sumo 45 flores hasta la esquina vacía.",
"lineHeight": 1.25
},
{
"id": "tex_aa248102de42",
"type": "text",
"x": 1174,
"y": 781.0,
"width": 808,
"height": 37.5,
"angle": 0,
"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
"backgroundColor": "transparent",
"fillStyle": "solid",
"strokeWidth": 1,
"strokeStyle": "solid",
"roughness": 0,
"opacity": 100,
"groupIds": [],
"frameId": null,
"roundness": null,
"seed": 1707499986,
"version": 1,
"versionNonce": 664156313,
"isDeleted": false,
"boundElements": null,
"updated": 1,
"link": null,
"locked": false,
"text": "→ Restricciones: cada avenida tiene garantizado al menos una esquina sin flor ni\npapel.",
"fontSize": 15,
"fontFamily": 2,
"textAlign": "left",
"verticalAlign": "top",
"baseline": 12,
"containerId": null,
"originalText": "→ Restricciones: cada avenida tiene garantizado al menos una esquina sin flor ni\npapel.",
"lineHeight": 1.25
},
{
"id": "tex_e7d55c957b51",
"type": "text",
"x": 1158,
"y": 832.5,
"width": 164.92,
"height": 17.5,
"angle": 0,
"strokeColor": "#495057",
"backgroundColor": "transparent",
"fillStyle": "solid",
"strokeWidth": 1,
"strokeStyle": "solid",
"roughness": 0,
"opacity": 100,
"groupIds": [],
"frameId": null,
"roundness": null,
"seed": 1506989102,
"version": 1,
"versionNonce": 1327612981,
"isDeleted": false,
"boundElements": null,
"updated": 1,
"link": null,
"locked": false,
"text": "Cómo lo resolvemos:",
"fontSize": 14,
"fontFamily": 2,
"textAlign": "left",
"verticalAlign": "top",
"baseline": 11,
"containerId": null,
"originalText": "Cómo lo resolvemos:",
"lineHeight": 1.25
},
{
"id": "tex_52338db3f9ef",
"type": "text",
"x": 1174,
"y": 856.0,
"width": 808,
"height": 56.25,
"angle": 0,
"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
"backgroundColor": "transparent",
"fillStyle": "solid",
"strokeWidth": 1,
"strokeStyle": "solid",
"roughness": 0,
"opacity": 100,
"groupIds": [],
"frameId": null,
"roundness": null,
"seed": 436445316,
"version": 1,
"versionNonce": 1830236562,
"isDeleted": false,
"boundElements": null,
"updated": 1,
"link": null,
"locked": false,
"text": "1. `RecorrerAvenidaHastaVacia(ES totalFlores)`: mientras la esquina tenga flor o\npapel, si tiene flor la toma y suma 1 a `totalFlores`, y avanza. Se detiene apenas la\nesquina no tiene ni flor ni papel.",
"fontSize": 15,
"fontFamily": 2,
"textAlign": "left",
"verticalAlign": "top",
"baseline": 12,
"containerId": null,
"originalText": "1. `RecorrerAvenidaHastaVacia(ES totalFlores)`: mientras la esquina tenga flor o\npapel, si tiene flor la toma y suma 1 a `totalFlores`, y avanza. Se detiene apenas la\nesquina no tiene ni flor ni papel.",
"lineHeight": 1.25
},
{
"id": "tex_a45bfe8219b2",
"type": "text",
"x": 1174,
"y": 916.25,
"width": 808,
"height": 37.5,
"angle": 0,
"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
"backgroundColor": "transparent",
"fillStyle": "solid",
"strokeWidth": 1,
"strokeStyle": "solid",
"roughness": 0,
"opacity": 100,
"groupIds": [],
"frameId": null,
"roundness": null,
"seed": 1719699960,
"version": 1,
"versionNonce": 2042104207,
"isDeleted": false,
"boundElements": null,
"updated": 1,
"link": null,
"locked": false,
"text": "2. `InformarAvenida(E floresAvenida)`: informa `1` si `floresAvenida <= 45`, si no\ninforma `0`.",
"fontSize": 15,
"fontFamily": 2,
"textAlign": "left",
"verticalAlign": "top",
"baseline": 12,
"containerId": null,
"originalText": "2. `InformarAvenida(E floresAvenida)`: informa `1` si `floresAvenida <= 45`, si no\ninforma `0`.",
"lineHeight": 1.25
},
{
"id": "tex_5d90068beaff",
"type": "text",
"x": 1174,
"y": 957.75,
"width": 808,
"height": 56.25,
"angle": 0,
"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
"backgroundColor": "transparent",
"fillStyle": "solid",
"strokeWidth": 1,
"strokeStyle": "solid",
"roughness": 0,
"opacity": 100,
"groupIds": [],
"frameId": null,
"roundness": null,
"seed": 512532260,
"version": 1,
"versionNonce": 1289266544,
"isDeleted": false,
"boundElements": null,
"updated": 1,
"link": null,
"locked": false,
"text": "3. Driver: repetir 99 veces (avenidas 1 a 99) reiniciar el contador, recorrer,\ninformar, y saltar a la avenida siguiente con `Pos(PosAv+1,1)`; después repetir una\nvez más para la avenida 100 (sin el salto final).",
"fontSize": 15,
"fontFamily": 2,
"textAlign": "left",
"verticalAlign": "top",
"baseline": 12,
"containerId": null,
"originalText": "3. Driver: repetir 99 veces (avenidas 1 a 99) reiniciar el contador, recorrer,\ninformar, y saltar a la avenida siguiente con `Pos(PosAv+1,1)`; después repetir una\nvez más para la avenida 100 (sin el salto final).",
"lineHeight": 1.25
},
